This product orchestrates independent upstream physics tools (MadGraph5_aMC@NLO, Pythia8,
Delphes, Rivet, ATLAS SimpleAnalysis, RestFrames, pyhf, SModelS, MadAnalysis 5, LHAPDF),
each the work of its own authors under its own license — see docs/reference/third-party.md.

The public analysis catalogue contains factual identifiers, short metadata,
source locations and hashes derived from the Rivet and ATLAS SimpleAnalysis
projects and the pyhf public probability-model index. Upstream revisions and
links are recorded in the catalogue. Their routines, learned model files and
reference datasets are not incorporated as RAVEL implementations. Catalogue
availability does not imply upstream endorsement or scientific validation.
